  "notes": [
    "The foundation shell is not counted as playable content.",
    "Counts may only advance when an item has a distinct gameplay role and tracked runtime asset/license state.",
    "W13 representative visual identities and W14 representative audio identities are tracked separately and do not falsely increment production gameplay-content counts.",
    "W15 records main-flow integration and first-expedition onboarding without falsely advancing production content counts or claiming final fun/readability review.",
    "W16 exposes six runtime-distinct character roles, unlock rules and role tutorials. The two W13 player identities are mapped to Aurora/Cinder, while all six remain excluded from implemented_content until final character-specific production art/audio/provenance and balance gates are complete.",
    "W17 expands the retained W09 causal system to 18 validated curated weapon definitions, 48 bounded relic definitions, six representative builds and transparent selection/comparison data. Production weapon/relic counts remain zero until final per-item production asset/provenance and human balance gates are complete.",
    "W18 maps the existing stage-1 and stage-2 campaign destinations into Glass Garden and Flooded Archive runtime regions with four distinct route geometries, two-phase objective gates, twelve deterministic regional entry behaviors and two project-original environment vectors. Production region/enemy-behavior counts remain zero until later boss/audio/full asset breadth and human quality gates are complete.",
    "W19 turns the two existing recoverable post-final world connections into Ash Railway and Eclipse Fortress runtime regions. Each connection has a distinct route, phase rule set, six regional behaviors, persistent world-axis/unlock effects and a project-original environment vector. W19 intentionally preserved the W18 three-segment world schema so W21 could perform an explicit save-compatible topology migration.",
    "W20 adds ten project-original vector boss identities and ten deterministic authored audio timbres covering fifty mechanical presentation cues. These assets are runtime-integrated but implemented_content.bosses intentionally remains zero until human visual, listening and balance gates pass.",
    "W21 promotes the two W19 connections into the segment-3 final regional branch, giving the campaign five parent-region identities while retaining two post-final continuation departures. The inner world snapshot advances from lanternfall-world-v1 to lanternfall-world-v2, but the W12 lanternfall-save-payload-v1 envelope and settlement IDs remain unchanged. Fresh pre-W21 completions enter the new final branch; saves that already completed a W19 connection remain campaign-complete and are not replayed. Production region counts remain zero pending human quality and later release gates."
  ]
